Urutan mode `concise` (bila > soft): (a) teks per item -> `text_max_chars`, (b) items -> 5 baris,
(c) list di `stats` -> top-5, (d) hapus field `drop_first`. Bila masih > hard (mode apa pun):
potong keras + `truncated: true` + `hint`.
